  &#160\;        </p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><p style="text-align: c
 enter\;"><em><strong>Multipurpose Room</strong></em></p><p>          Curr
 ently Featuring:<i> The Gift of Collecting: Tina Jernigan</i></p><p>     
      Jernigan was a passionate supporter of both Indiana University and t
 he arts. She donated artworks to the IU Public Art and Cultural Heritage 
