DESCRIPTION:Open. Find. Make. Wear. Start with a real oyster. Discover th
 e pearl hidden inside. Then work one-on-one with a student jeweler to tra
 nsform your pearl into jewelry you make yourself. No experience required.
 Two sessions are available\, 10 makers each:  Session 1: 9am–12pm  Sess
 ion 2: 2–5pm  Earrings: $85  Pendant: $70  Limited space. To register\,
  use the QR code in the second image above or visit the link under "Relat
 ed content" below.The registration deadline is Saturday\, September 12 at
  8:00am.
