DESCRIPTION:Open. Find. Make. Wear. Start with a real oyster. Discover th
 e pearl hidden inside. Then work one-on-one with a student jeweler to tra
 nsform your pearl into jewelry you make yourself. No experience required.
 Two sessions are available\, 10 makers each:  Session 1: 9am–12pm  Sess
 ion 2: 2–5pm  Earrings: $85  Pendant: $70  Limited space. To register\,
  use the QR code in the second image above or visit the link under "Relat
 ed content" below.The registration deadline is Saturday\, September 12 at
  8:00am.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><strong>Open. Find. Make. Wear.</strong> 
 Start with a real oyster. Discover the pearl hidden inside. Then work one
 -on-one with a student jeweler to transform your pearl into jewelry you m
 ake yourself. No experience required.</p><p><strong>Two sessions are avai
 lable\, 10 makers each:</strong><br />  Session 1: 9am–12pm<br />  Sess
 ion 2: 2–5pm</p><p>  Earrings: $85<br />  Pendant: $70</p><p>  Limited 
 space. To register\, use the QR code in the second image above or visit t
 he link under "Related content" below.</p><p><strong>The registration dea
 dline is Saturday\, September 12 at 8:00am.</strong></p>
