SUMMARY:Retail & Fine Arts Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop-In
DESCRIPTION:Career fair season is here! Is your resume ready to share wit
 h employers? Stop by Kirkwood Hall for a Career Fair Resume Drop-In for q
 uick\, personalized feedback before meeting with recruiters. A career coa
 ch will help you strengthen your resumes\, highlight your most relevant e
 xperiences\, and make last-minute improvements so you can attend the fair
  with confidence.&#160\;Who should attend:&#160\;  Students from any majo
 r who plan to attend the Retail Career Fair and/or the Fine Arts Career F
 air that would like brief resume feedback before connecting with employer
 s.&#160\;  No appointment is required. Bring a printed or digital copy of
  your resume.&#160\;  Can't make it? Attend the other Career Fair Prep: R
 esume Drop-In (https://events.iu.edu/iuwalter/event/2380053-retail-and-fi
 ne-arts-career-fair-prep-resume) on Tuesday\, September 29&#160\;or stop 
 by Ernie Pyle Hall for drop-in coaching (https://careers.college.indiana.
 edu/about/explore-our-center/drop-in-coaching/index.html) from 10am-4pm a
 ny weekday during the school year.&#160\;  This event is Momentum eligibl
 e.
