 elf\,</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">STORY</span></i><span data-cont
 rast="auto">poses the question: What is homeland? Every nation and people
  possess a creation myth that narrates the beginning of their community a
 nd sustains their collective identity. Yet\, for</span><span data-contras
